Intel RDFP test vectors
=======================

`TESTS/readtest.in` and `TESTS/README` come from Intel's Decimal
Floating-Point Math Library (Intel RDFP Math Library 2.0 Update 4).
They are the correctness oracle for BID64 and BID128 in this Java port.

The original C library is not vendored in this repository. Obtain it from
Intel if you need the C sources, then run the optional native oracle:

```
INTEL_RDFP_HOME=/path/to/IntelRDFPMathLib20U4 ./dev/run_intel_readtest.sh
```

That builds Intel `LIBRARY` and `TESTS/readtest` with
`CALL_BY_REF=0 GLOBAL_RND=0 GLOBAL_FLAGS=0` and feeds this repo's
`TESTS/readtest.in`. It is skipped unless `INTEL_RDFP_HOME` is set.
JUnit test `IntelNativeReadtestTest` uses the same gate.

https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/developer/articles/tool/intel-decimal-floating-point-math-library.html

